WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.036
-Last time you were here you had
just come back from Asia.

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:03.903 line:92%
You'd been doing touring there,

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
and now this time you're just
back from Europe.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:07.374 line:92%
How was your Europe travels?

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.875 line:92%
-You know, I got back on Sunday.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm still
a little bit delirious.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.614
-I mean, the transatlantic
flight, that is no joke, right?

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I guess
that's the only option, right,

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:19.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get across the Atlantic.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is a flight.
-Trans is the only way.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:22.956 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right?

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
You never really --
there's no people like,

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know what? I jet-skied."
You know?

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.294 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:31.031 line:92%
But it's an insane flight.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:34.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are messed up
after that flight, for days.

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:37.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like, "I need a day.
I need a day."

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.706 line:92%
But it doesn't seem that hard.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.074 line:92%
You're like, "It was hard."

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:45.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had to sit in a comfortable
chair for six hours.

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.112 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And watch movies.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
I felt like
I was being waterboarded.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:50.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:51.684 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
People complain.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:55.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
It used to take six weeks.
-Yeah.

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:56.122 line:92%
-It used to take six weeks

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get from Europe
to the Western Hemisphere,

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:02.729
and even back then people were
like, "That's great." You know?

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.263 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That's good.
Like how long did it take?"

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Six weeks."
"Oh, that's good."

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.501 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"Yeah, I was productive.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read every book that's ever
been printed."

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
You know?

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.407 line:92%
But that's how Columbus --

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:18.678
he, you know, got from Spain to
the Western Hemisphere,

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.179 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
six weeks.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:22.982
And you know, he got here and he
was like, "I need a day."

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:23.516 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
"I am so boatlagged."

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:26.853 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.454 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Give me a day,

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:31.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I'll get right to
raping and murdering."

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:31.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:35.562
-You can't do that exhausted.
You just can't do it exhausted.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:35.962 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.464 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Paris? How was Paris?

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Paris was amazing.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess I was there
like eight days ago,

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I am still
digesting the cheese.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:48.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My delicate American body...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
...could not handle
the cheese-cheese.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, because you eat cheese
here in the States.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My wife is from Wisconsin.
I love cheese.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:56.516 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But the cheese --
the French have a --

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:02.689 size:84% position:42%
They take eating cheese
to a whole other level.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
They make it an entire course
at the meal.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you'll have an appetizer,
an entrée,

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then for absolutely
no reason at all,

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
a bunch of chunks of cheese,
then dessert.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:17.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
After that you go to
the hospital.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:18.671 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.506 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But it's amazing.

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:22.509
It's not like I don't eat cheese
that way,

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:25.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
but just not in public.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:25.845 size:78% position:39% line:92%
You know what I mean?

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:29.916
Eating chunks of cheese,
that's what I get caught doing.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:30.617 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:31.584 size:78% position:39% line:92%
You know what I mean?

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first time
I had the cheese course,

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
I actually heard my heart say,
"Are you mad at me?"

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.224 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
My brain took over.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:41.461
It's like, "It's going to be
fine. Everyone relax. Relax.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.729 line:92%
There's going to be sweating.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's going to be
a lot of sweating.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:45.932 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, bowels, you can take
a couple weeks off."

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:49.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.270 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But it was amazing.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
I tried dozens of
French cheeses,

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.842 size:88% position:44%
and I couldn't tell you
the name of one of them.

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:57.810 line:92%
And they told me the names.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:58.411 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
They'd be like,

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:02.248
"This is Shaw-shaw-shaw
from the Shaw-shaw-shaw region."

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'd be like,
"So not cheddar?"

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:05.785 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:06.619 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was amazing.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You also made it
to Scandinavia.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:11.224 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I did. Scandinavia.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:11.624 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Finland.

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:15.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Finland. I went all around
the Nordic countries

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.196 line:92%
and ate a lot of reindeer.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:20.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did. You're not joking.
This is a photo you took.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:20.633 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There was a place
that was selling reindeer.

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.637 line:92%
-This was, I think, in Finland.

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:27.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
But in Norway, I went in
a butcher shop,

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they had a sale
on reindeer meat.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:33.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nothing says
Christmas season is over...

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.380 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
...quite like a sale
on reindeer meat.

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:38.484 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:42.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's got to be
a tough day for Santa.

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:42.855 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:45.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I want to thank
all the reindeer

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:46.793 size:88% position:44% line:92%
for your work this year.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:48.228 line:92%
Now, when I call your name,

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:51.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you could come with me
in the smokehouse.

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:53.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Donner!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.300 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But it was amazing.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stockholm?
-Stockholm.

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.237 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Beautiful city.

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.172 line:92%
-Beautiful city, and you know,

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:01.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
you go to so many
of these places,

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.142 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and you really want to

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:05.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
experience
the tourist attraction.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:09.482
In Stockholm, the big attraction
is the Vasa Museum,

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.383 size:84% position:42% line:92%
which is a ship museum.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:14.254
But there is -- You go there,
and there's only one ship.

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:18.057
So it's less of a museum.
It's like a ship garage.

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:18.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:22.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you learn --
I learned that this ship,

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:25.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
essentially it floated
for like a moment,

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then it sunk in
Stockholm Harbor.

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:31.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
So their museum is a boat
that didn't float.

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:31.904 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:35.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, most countries, their
largest tourist attraction is,

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:41.281
you know, an engineering marvel,
or some beautiful natural thing.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:45.318
In Stockholm, they're like "This
is a boat that didn't float.

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:49.956
This is why we make furniture."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:52.659 line:92%
But it is a beautiful boat.

